			"accessedAt": "2026-08-07",
			"note": "Yields assume capped item-drop rate. The calculator does not model item-drop rate; players are assumed to reach cap with or without selected buffs. D4 is 115 average raw plus three decomposed bases (118 of each material). Pleroma/Emeraldia D5 adds six bases (121 each). Icarus/Rikimo D5 also includes one decomposed bonus base plus a random 7–15-material bag, yielding 127.5 expected of each type. Every D5 also gives three tradable advanced coupons and 21 dungeon stones."
		},
		{
			"id": "maintainer-confirmed-services",
			"kind": "maintainer-input",
			"title": "Maintainer-confirmed service assumptions",
			"url": null,
			"accessedAt": "2026-08-07",
			"note": "Customers supply the equipment and Seal Locks. Pleroma services require both main material types simultaneously at the listed quantity for each. Initial lock counts are 40 for +6 and 50 for +7; 60,000,000 Ely per lock is informational and never deducted from provider proceeds. Icarus/Rikimo customer prices remain provisional."
		},
