			"note": "Combat and Utility Elixirs are always used together as Flasks. Sweet Mutant is not purchased. Premium Syrup lasts two hours; Advanced Premium lasts one hour and can be made from two Premium Syrups. Guild foods and Hero's Defense Nostrum are excluded."
